  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have embraced the secrets of death and been changed by them.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Intelligence 14+, Abaddon’s Aspect</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per day, you may choose to immediately dismiss Abaddon’s Aspect to gain the benefits of the death ward spell, which lasts for a number of minutes equal to your character level. Additionally, if you are a spellcaster, you may add the death ward spell to your spell list as a 4th level spell, even if it normally does not normally appear on it.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
